sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant A0 as Runtime
  participant A1 as Tool Gateway
  participant A2 as Policy / Registry
  participant A3 as Credential Broker
  participant A4 as Tool Adapter / Tool
  A0->>A1: toolId/version + arguments + trace
  A1->>A2: Resolve descriptor / validate / authorize
  A2->>A1: Policy evidence / approval if write
  A1->>A3: Audience + scopes + delegation + binding
  A3->>A2: Revalidate decision / expiry / grant
  A3->>A1: Opaque non-exportable lease
  A1->>A4: Adapter consumes bound lease
  A4->>A4: Inject credential inside trusted boundary
  A4->>A1: Schema-validated output
  A1->>A0: Sanitized result (no token / lease)

